  "description": "This royal blue letterman jacket suits students, teams and graduating groups seeking a crisp two-tone look. Its royal blue body and white sleeves give each wearer room to add personal details within a coordinated outfit.\n\nDetails\n- Body: royal blue 24 oz melton wool\n- Sleeves: white genuine cowhide leather\n- Trim: royal blue and white striped knit collar, cuffs and waistband\n- Lining: quilted lining\n- Closure: snap-button front\n- Pockets: two welt pockets\n- Fit: True-to-size fit; compare your measurements with the size guide\n- Sizes: XXS through 6XL\n\nCustomization options\n- Chenille letter and name embroidery\n- Number, patches and back lettering\n- Free digital design proof before production.\n\nExplore royal blue varsity jacket styling or blue and white letterman jacket with your own personal details. Choose your layout through our [custom letterman jacket](/custom-letterman-jackets) options and review the placement before production.\n\nProduction and delivery\nMade in our Sialkot factory. Made in 6–7 business days after design approval. Delivery in 5–7 business days.",
